    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d727">

                <pb facs="0771" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg721"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi><anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d727-f1"/></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1894-12-10"><hi rendition="#italic">December
                                10, 1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Complications arose after your refusal that made the Porte decline your friendly
                    mediation on terms proposed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d727-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d727-f1-content">
                <p>The correspondence following was exchanged since the date of the President’s
                    message of December 11, 1894.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
